    <pubDate>Fri, 26 Aug 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎来到【放肆生长】的第一期，我@大敏和小李@小李在这一期围绕着两个话题聊了一个多小时。</span></p><span></span><p><span>[我们是谁]</span></p><span></span><p><span>[工作之余还有什么爱好]</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：Summer - 久石让</span></p><span></span><p><span>P1</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">00:55</a> 做一个简单的自我介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="205">03:25</a> 为什么想要做博客</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="593">09:53</a> 播客为什么叫【放肆生长】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="730">12:10</a> 播客未来会做些什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1072">17:52</a> 突然聊起电视剧《人世间》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1554">25:54</a> 录播客可以避免露脸的尴尬</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1945">32:25</a> 推荐两个最喜欢的播客吧</span></p><span></span><p><span>P2</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2208">36:48</a> 深圳和东北二线小城市真的太不一样了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3067">51:07</a> 工作了之后有爱好真的是很奢侈的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3880">64:40</a> 下班后的工作消息你会回么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4260">71:00</a> 对于播客未来的期许</span></p><span></span><p><span>tips：第二期预告</span></p><span></span><p><span>开学季特别节目</span></p><span></span><p><span>毕业一年&amp;毕业几年&amp;正在读大学的三位女生一起聊一聊，大学那些事儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢你的收听~</span></p>]]></description>
